    <string name="warning_content">For driving safety, please use this system and its functions while the vehicle is stationary \n\nTSR feature is designed to provide drivers with accurate information about the speed limit signs on the road. To ensure the accuracy, the system needs to consume data to obtain the latest map data, so it is recommended to use it with Wi-Fi/hotspot (You can also switch on the TSR Cellular Connection in the Settings, but this will cause cellular data consumption. If the data consumed reaches the monthly limit, you will not be able to use the data for map updates). Off-line map may not use the latest data. Please refer to actual road signs</string>
